    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become part of an elite special forces unit in Tactical Assault VR!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Assault VR is an intense tactical shooter where you use real-world CQB (Close Quarters Battles) tactics to stack up, breach doors and eliminate threats. Play solo or join an online co-op special forces unit in missions around the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PvE Missions: Solo or Online Multiplayer Co-Op with Up to 8 Players on PCVR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/89188aef56ba00d83e1b7ebd67370e68.poster.avif?t=1748030799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/89188aef56ba00d83e1b7ebd67370e68.webm?t=1748030799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/89188aef56ba00d83e1b7ebd67370e68.mp4?t=1748030799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PvP: Competitive Online Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/b6a9d070a021f28e736686a14e34b479.poster.avif?t=1748030799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/b6a9d070a021f28e736686a14e34b479.webm?t=1748030799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/b6a9d070a021f28e736686a14e34b479.mp4?t=1748030799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >7 Non-Linear, Asymmetrical Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your assault. Th